Muslims in general for the acts of Osama bin Laden and a=20
hand-full of his followers=E2=80=94just as it would be illogical to blame=
=20
Americans in general for the beliefs and acts of the Ku Klux Klan.=20
However, it has seldom been possible to get people to engage in=20
this kind of rational discussion when they believe that they, their=20
