Another approach to stopping attacks on Muslims because=20
of the 9/11 attacks would be to show how many fundamental=20
aspects of the official account of 9/11 are not true. This approach=20
has been exemplified in the present book. It differs from previous=20
attempts to expose the truth by having a panel of experts from=20
various countries and expertise evaluate claims made by the offi-=20
cial account of the 9/11 attacks.=20

The panel looked at claims made in the official account=20
about nine features of the 9/11 attacks: (1) The destruction of=20
the Twin Towers; (2) the destruction of WTC 7; (3) the attack=20
on the Pentagon; (4) the 9/11 flights; (5) US military exercises=20
that occurred on or before 9/11; (6) the behavior on 9/11 of mil-=20
itary and political leaders with roles that put them in positions=20
to affect what happened on 9/11; (7) Osama bin Laden and the=20
men designated as hijackers; (8) the reported phone calls from=20


